    ],
    "kind": "ui"
  },
  {
    "source": "An infernal piece of technology, seemingly designed to serve as a sort of guard. It hovers around, searching the area for interlopers to blast on sight. It appears to have some organic parts, and may even be a conscious living being.",
    "target": "一件地狱般的科技造物，似乎是作为守卫设计的。它在空中盘旋搜索闯入者，一发现目标便立即开火。它似乎带有一些有机部件，甚至可能是有意识的活物。",
