  {
    "source": "Beckoned by The Thousand-Faced Moon into laying its mind bare for the occult, the psyche of this hierophant was ravaged by scores of entities from fiendish realities. They had it gouge out its eyes and tongue, and left it a husk of former humanity. Now it lumbers about aimlessly, brandishing a spiked mace with which it flays itself in mockery of physical anguish.",
    "target": "这名圣职者受到千面之月的召唤，将心智暴露给神秘学力量，随后被来自恶魔现实的无数存在撕碎了精神。它们命令他挖去双眼与舌头，只留下昔日人性的空壳。如今他漫无目的地蹒跚前行，挥舞着一柄尖刺狼牙棒，仿佛以剥皮自虐来嘲弄肉体的痛苦。",
    "locations": [
      "installed_files/data/monsters.xml:/monsters/monster[@id=MON_ZEALOT]/text/description"
    ],
    "kind": "ui"
  },
  {
    "source": "Before me lies a twilit grotto of enormous height. An insane tangle of human bones extends for yards like a foamy sea - invariably in postures of demoniac frenzy, either fighting off some menace or clutching other forms with cannibal intent.",
    "target": "暮色笼罩的巨大洞窟展现在我眼前。疯狂纠缠的人骨绵延数码，宛如泡沫翻涌的海洋——它们无不保持着恶魔般狂乱的姿势，有的抵御某种威胁，有的则怀着食人的意图紧抱着其他骸骨。",
    "locations": [
      "src/terrain_event.cpp:477"
    ],
    "kind": "ui"
  },
