    "source": "Being in a state of extreme mental shock (stress, paranoia) will cause a sanity hit. One way to reduce shock, and thereby avoiding or prolonging the sanity hit, is to find a source of light - for example through activating an Electric Lantern or igniting a Flare.",
    "target": "处于极度精神震慑（压力、偏执）状态会损害理智。降低震慑、从而避免或推迟理智受损的一种方法是寻找光源，例如开启电灯笼或点燃照明棒。",
